  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a776487618c5eca41bfe2a54260297f7, type: 3}
  m_Name: Paypal for Shop
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Name: Paypal for Shop
  Version: 1.0.5
  MinMFPSVersion: 1.9
  Instructions: "<b>Required:</b>\n\nMFPS 1.9++\nShop 1.2.0++\nULogin Pro 1.9.47++\n\n<b>Documentation
    At:</b> MFPS -> Tutorials -> Shop Paypal\n\n<b>Shop Paypal</b> is an extension
    of the Shop Addon for MFPS 2.0 which handles the client side code for Paypal
    checkout API, with this addon you can accept in-game payments using Paypal in
    pretty much any platform that allow its <i>(Google, Facebook and Apple for example
    doesn't allow it)</i>, but this is one of the best payment solution for PC and
    WebGL.\n\nThe plugin use the official <b>Paypal Checkout API v2</b> without external
    plugins required.\n\n<b><size=16>How the system works?</size></b>\n\n1 - The
    user intent to buy a game item.\n2 - The game call the PayPal API to set up the
    payment.\r\n3 - The game receive the authorization from the Paypal server and
    start the checkout flow in the platform browser.\n4 - The game confirm the status
    of the payment -> complete the purchase and save the data in the user account
    <i>(using ULogin Pro)</i>.\n\n<b>Features:</b>\n\n\u2022  2-Clicks integration.\n\u2022 
    Latest Paypal Checkout API (v2)\n\u2022  Sandbox and Live mode support.\n\u2022 
    Test payments in UnityEditor.\n\u2022  All Paypal currencys.\n\u2022  Setup for
    Digital Products.\n\u2022  Works on all platforms.\n\u2022  Tutorial for set
    up your Paypal development environment.\n"
  TutorialScript: PaypalForShopDocumentation
